links.description:
{orphans} MAC(s) seen by your router on at least {days} different days are linked to no device:

{macs}

{proposals} proposal(s) found by name. Nothing is selected by default; your choices are stored in MAC Registry; the device itself is only changed when writing to the device is on in the options.

duplicate_macs.description:
These MACs belong to several devices of the same integration:

{macs}

Devices of different integrations sharing a MAC are normal and are linked together; two devices of one integration usually mean the same appliance was added twice. MAC Registry changes nothing; check whether one of them can be removed.
